<div class="page">
  <div class="small-text" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    Linden School Nominees presented by Dr. <span data-field="linden_school_nominee_presenter">{{ linden_school_nominee_presenter }}</span>
    <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
      Linden School is an honorary society comprised of students who excel academically and have a dedication to serving both the University and the community as a whole. Linden School participation is by nomination only and students are recognized for their service and academic leadership through faculty nominations.
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div>
      <div class="small-text">2013 Inductees</div>
      <div class="small-text" style="margin-top: 5px;">
